ProsperoSunshine: the paired clients for the app: a new name, and the mode each last asked for

The control socket lists, renames and removes paired clients; upstream only has its web page for that, which the PS5
host does not run. The listener hands the mode of every launch or resume to the host, which keeps it per client
(src/control/device_modes.hpp), so a launch never rewrites the pairing file.

